  "body": "Goal: The tool library window edits user holders and component assemblies. This moves the work of #3648 into the new dialog.\n\nParent: #3663. Plan: the implementation plan in the #3663 comment. This is PR U7 of 11 and the last one. Fixes #3648 after that issue is retargeted at this dialog.\n\nFiles:\n- Add the \"My library\" source in `tool_library_dialog/list.rs`.\n- Add holder editor writes in `holders.rs`.\n- Add the component stack in `assembly_group.rs`.\n- The holder key moves from the entry name to the `library_ref` of #3645.\n\nTests: the \"Done means\" list of #3648, in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/`.\n\nDepends on:\n- U4 (#3895) and U6 (#3897).\n- The component track: #3642, #3643, #3644 and #3645. None of it is started.\n- #3647 for the MCP side.\n- #3648 (the scope of this issue).\n\nCommands: the ones that #3644 and #3645 add. Their MCP tools belong to #3647. The project-file and `.camtools` version steps belong to #3645, not to this PR.\n\nExpected quick gate: not known until #3645 sets its files. If it touches `schema.rs`, that file alone adds 40 steps.\n\nDone means: a user edits a user holder and a component assembly in the window, with undo, and the \"Done means\" list of #3648 is met.\n\nChangelog row: written when the scope is fixed.\n",
